      "id": "mathematics-03-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The diagonal of a rectangle is √41 cm and its area is 20 cm². What is the perimeter of the rectangle?",
      "options": {
        "A": "18 cm",
        "B": "20 cm",
        "C": "22 cm",
        "D": "24 cm"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "l² + b² = 41 and lb = 20. (l+b)² = l² + b² + 2lb = 41 + 40 = 81 => l+b = 9. Perimeter = 2(l+b) = 18.",
      "hash": "9eb73ddee8d4aa98",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक आयत का विकर्ण √41 सेमी है और इसका क्षेत्रफल 20 सेमी² है। आयत का परिमाप क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "18 सेमी",
            "B": "20 सेमी",
            "C": "22 सेमी",
            "D": "24 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "l² + b² = 41 और lb = 20. (l+b)² = l² + b² + 2lb = 41 + 40 = 81 => l+b = 9. परिमाप = 2(l+b) = 18."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If the simple interest in 7 years is equal to 70% of the principal, what is the rate of interest per annum?",
      "options": {
        "A": "5%",
        "B": "10%",
        "C": "7%",
        "D": "12%"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "SI = 0.7P. Time = 7 years. R = (SI * 100) / (P * T) = (0.7P * 100) / (P * 7) = 70/7 = 10%.",
      "hash": "3e734c062a1d7a1d",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 7 वर्ष में साधारण ब्याज मूलधन के 70% के बराबर है, तो प्रति वर्ष ब्याज दर क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "5%",
            "B": "10%",
            "C": "7%",
            "D": "12%"
          },
          "explanation": "SI = 0.7P. समय = 7 वर्ष। R = (SI * 100) / (P * T) = (0.7P * 100) / (P * 7) = 70/7 = 10%."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The sum of two numbers is 25 and their difference is 13. Find their product.",
      "options": {
        "A": "104",
        "B": "114",
        "C": "325",
        "D": "214"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "x + y = 25, x - y = 13. Adding, 2x = 38 => x = 19. y = 6. Product = 19 * 6 = 114.",
      "hash": "4a56f2b09c6512e8",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का योग 25 है और उनका अंतर 13 है। उनका गुणनफल ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "104",
            "B": "114",
            "C": "325",
            "D": "214"
          },
          "explanation": "x + y = 25, x - y = 13. जोड़ने पर 2x = 38 => x = 19. y = 6. गुणनफल = 19 * 6 = 114."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "A shopkeeper claims to sell at cost price but uses a weight of 900 gm instead of 1 kg. What is his profit percentage?",
      "options": {
        "A": "10%",
        "B": "11.11%",
        "C": "9.09%",
        "D": "12.5%"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Profit = (Error / True Value - Error) * 100 = (100 / 900) * 100 = 100/9 = 11.11%.",
      "hash": "9897e5feb44fa139",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक दुकानदार लागत मूल्य पर बेचने का दावा करता है लेकिन 1 किलो के स्थान पर 900 ग्राम वजन का उपयोग करता है। उसका लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "10%",
            "B": "11.11%",
            "C": "9.09%",
            "D": "12.5%"
          },
          "explanation": "लाभ = (त्रुटि / सही मान - त्रुटि) * 100 = (100 / 900) * 100 = 100/9 = 11.11%."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "The average of 50 numbers is 38. If two numbers, 45 and 55 are discarded, the average of the remaining numbers is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "36.5",
        "B": "37.5",
        "C": "37",
        "D": "38"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Total sum = 50 * 38 = 1900. New sum = 1900 - (45+55) = 1800. New Average = 1800 / 48 = 37.5.",
      "hash": "46193d5563fedfae",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "50 संख्याओं का औसत 38 है। यदि दो संख्याएँ, 45 और 55 को हटा दिया जाए, तो शेष संख्याओं का औसत क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "36.5",
            "B": "37.5",
            "C": "37",
            "D": "38"
          },
          "explanation": "कुल योग = 50 * 38 = 1900. नया योग = 1900 - (45+55) = 1800. नया औसत = 1800 / 48 = 37.5."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If x/y = 3/4, then what is the value of (2x + 3y) / (3y - 2x)?",
      "options": {
        "A": "2",
        "B": "3",
        "C": "1",
        "D": "4"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Put x=3, y=4. (2*3 + 3*4) / (3*4 - 2*3) = (6+12)/(12-6) = 18/6 = 3.",
      "hash": "6dbcb041723ab9b8",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि x/y = 3/4 है, तो (2x + 3y) / (3y - 2x) का मान क्या होगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "2",
            "B": "3",
            "C": "1",
            "D": "4"
          },
          "explanation": "x=3, y=4 रखें। (2*3 + 3*4) / (3*4 - 2*3) = (6+12)/(12-6) = 18/6 = 3."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "What is the value of sin(45° + θ) - cos(45° - θ)?",
      "options": {
        "A": "1",
        "B": "0",
        "C": "2sinθ",
        "D": "2cosθ"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "cos(45°-θ) = sin(90° - (45°-θ)) = sin(45°+θ). Therefore, sin(45°+θ) - sin(45°+θ) = 0.",
      "hash": "491a7ce80a97be31",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "sin(45° + θ) - cos(45° - θ) का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "1",
            "B": "0",
            "C": "2sinθ",
            "D": "2cosθ"
          },
          "explanation": "cos(45°-θ) = sin(90° - (45°-θ)) = sin(45°+θ). इसलिए, sin(45°+θ) - sin(45°+θ) = 0."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "The height of an equilateral triangle is 10√3 cm. What is its perimeter?",
      "options": {
        "A": "30 cm",
        "B": "60 cm",
        "C": "45 cm",
        "D": "90 cm"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Height = (√3/2) * a. 10√3 = (√3/2) * a => a = 20. Perimeter = 3a = 60 cm.",
      "hash": "6c8332ed435764ee",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक समबाहु त्रिभुज की ऊँचाई 10√3 सेमी है। इसका परिमाप क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "30 सेमी",
            "B": "60 सेमी",
            "C": "45 सेमी",
            "D": "90 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "ऊँचाई = (√3/2) * a. 10√3 = (√3/2) * a => a = 20. परिमाप = 3a = 60 सेमी।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
