      "hash": "36ee47ea02ae6961",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 5 tan θ = 4 है, तो (5 sin θ - 3 cos θ) / (5 sin θ + 2 cos θ) का मान ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "1/6",
            "B": "1/3",
            "C": "1/4",
            "D": "1/5"
          },
          "explanation": "अंश और हर को cos θ से विभाजित करें। (5 tan θ - 3)/(5 tan θ + 2). मान रखें: (4-3)/(4+2) = 1/6."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-016",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "A bag contains 50p, 25p and 10p coins in ratio 5:9:4, amounting to ₹206. Find the number of 25p coins.",
