    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-021",
      "number": 21,
      "question": "A father's age is 3 times his son's age. After 12 years, father's age will be 2 times the son's age. What is the father's present age?",
      "options": {
        "A": "36 years",
        "B": "42 years",
        "C": "48 years",
        "D": "30 years"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "3x+12 = 2(x+12) => 3x+12 = 2x+24 => x=12. Father = 3x = 36 years.",
      "hash": "c2c339f779b99e77",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक पिता की आयु उसके पुत्र की आयु की 3 गुना है। 12 वर्ष बाद, पिता की आयु पुत्र की आयु की 2 गुना होगी। पिता की वर्तमान आयु क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "36 वर्ष",
            "B": "42 वर्ष",
            "C": "48 वर्ष",
            "D": "30 वर्ष"
          },
          "explanation": "3x+12 = 2(x+12) => 3x+12 = 2x+24 => x=12. पिता = 3x = 36 वर्ष।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-022",
      "number": 22,
      "question": "A pipe can fill a tank in 5 hours, but due to a leak it takes 6 hours. In what time can the leak empty the full tank?",
      "options": {
        "A": "30 hrs",
        "B": "11 hrs",
        "C": "25 hrs",
        "D": "15 hrs"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Leak rate = (1/5) - (1/6) = 1/30. So 30 hours.",
      "hash": "497b9befd17172ed",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक पाइप एक टंकी को 5 घंटे में भर सकता है, लेकिन रिसाव के कारण इसे भरने में 6 घंटे लगते हैं। रिसाव भरी हुई टंकी को कितने समय में खाली कर सकता है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "30 घंटे",
            "B": "11 घंटे",
            "C": "25 घंटे",
            "D": "15 घंटे"
          },
          "explanation": "रिसाव की दर = (1/5) - (1/6) = 1/30। अतः 30 घंटे।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-023",
      "number": 23,
      "question": "The average of 11 results is 50. If the average of the first 6 is 49 and that of the last 6 is 52, what is the 6th result?",
      "options": {
        "A": "48",
        "B": "50",
        "C": "56",
        "D": "52"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "6th = (6*49 + 6*52) - (11*50) = 6(101) - 550 = 606 - 550 = 56.",
      "hash": "e04df54733da9c62",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "11 परिणामों का औसत 50 है। यदि पहले 6 का औसत 49 है और अंतिम 6 का औसत 52 है, तो छठा परिणाम क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "48",
            "B": "50",
            "C": "56",
            "D": "52"
          },
          "explanation": "6वां = (6*49 + 6*52) - (11*50) = 6(101) - 550 = 606 - 550 = 56."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-024",
      "number": 24,
      "question": "If 1² + 2² + ... + 10² = 385, then find the value of 2² + 4² + ... + 20².",
      "options": {
        "A": "770",
        "B": "1540",
        "C": "1155",
        "D": "3850"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "It is 4 times (1² + 2² + ... + 10²) (Taking 2² common). 4 * 385 = 1540.",
      "hash": "72a2db194f260143",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 1² + 2² + ... + 10² = 385 है, तो 2² + 4² + ... + 20² का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "770",
            "B": "1540",
            "C": "1155",
            "D": "3850"
          },
          "explanation": "यह (1² + 2² + ... + 10²) का 4 गुना है (2² कॉमन लेने पर)। 4 * 385 = 1540."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-03-025",
      "number": 25,
      "question": "The ratio of radii of two cylinders is 2:3 and ratio of their heights is 5:3. What is the ratio of their volumes?",
      "options": {
        "A": "27:20",
        "B": "20:27",
        "C": "4:9",
        "D": "10:9"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "V1/V2 = (r1/r2)² * (h1/h2) = (2/3)² * (5/3) = (4/9) * (5/3) = 20:27.",
      "hash": "ab41b0e4520ebca6",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो सिलेंडरों (Cylinders) की त्रिज्या का अनुपात 2:3 है और उनकी ऊंचाइयों का अनुपात 5:3 है। उनके आयतनों का अनुपात क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "27:20",
            "B": "20:27",
            "C": "4:9",
            "D": "10:9"
          },
          "explanation": "V1/V2 = (r1/r2)² * (h1/h2) = (2/3)² * (5/3) = (4/9) * (5/3) = 20:27."
        }
      }
    },
